<p>Mai falak ki sataayi hu nana<br />
Ujde kunbe ko laayi hu nana</p>

<p>Mere shaane mulaaheza keeje<br />
Neel dikhlaane aayi hu nana</p>

<p>Behre soughaate fatima soughra<br />
Kurta bhai ka laayi hu nana</p>

<p>Todi zaalim ne pasliyaa'n jiski<br />
Mai usi maa ki jaayi hu nana</p>

<p>Mai madine se karbala jaakar<br />
Bhai ko kho ke aayi hu nana</p>

<p>Be kafan dafn karke bhai ko<br />
Be rida hoke aayi hu nana</p>

<p>Kehna zainab ka aah wo hilmi<br />
Mai falak ki sataayi hu nana<br />
</p>